Section: devel
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.7.2

Package: pr-agent-deps
Version: 1.0
Maintainer: Ofir Friedman <ofir.f@qodo.ai>
Depends:
 python3 (>= 3.12),
 python3-venv,
 python3-pip,
 python3-dynaconf,
 python3-html2text,
 python3-pytest (>= 9),
 python3-pytest-asyncio,
 python3-flake8 (>= 7.3),
 gettext,
 git
Architecture: all
Description: Development dependencies for PR-Agent
 Installs the Debian packages needed to create the Python environment, compile
 localization catalogs, and run PR-Agent's unit tests and lint checks.
 .
 Python dependencies without Debian packages must still be installed from
 requirements.txt and requirements-dev.txt in a virtual environment.
